# Licence — this repository is mixed

**There is no single licence for this repository. Read `LICENSE-NOTICE.md`.**

Three different bodies of work sit here, under three different sets of terms:

| what | licence | file |
|---|---|---|
| the native-readout shim (`shim/`) | Apache-2.0 | `LICENSE-APACHE-2.0` |
| the vLLM sources the patches modify | Apache-2.0 | upstream vLLM |
| **the patch set (`patches/`)** | **partly AGPL-3.0 — not ours to relicense** | `LICENSE-NOTICE.md` |

`patches/` derives in part from **MiaAI Lab's AGPL-3.0**
[`Qwen3.8-Flash-Next-Single-DGX-Spark`](https://github.com/MiaAI-Lab/Qwen3.8-Flash-Next-Single-DGX-Spark)
recipe. Because AGPL-3.0 code cannot be relicensed by us, **`patches/` as a whole is not offered under
Apache-2.0**, and an earlier version of this repository said that it was. `LICENSE-NOTICE.md` states the
current position and the plan to resolve it; `CREDITS.md` names everyone whose work is here.

The Apache-2.0 text is kept at `LICENSE-APACHE-2.0` and applies to the shim and to our own original
code — **not** to `patches/`.

If you are here to use the patch set, read `LICENSE-NOTICE.md` first. If you are MiaAI Lab and you want
something changed about how your work is described here, please open an issue and we will change it.
